1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,900
Eighty-six percent of oncology trials fail to recruit on time,

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:10,260
while clinical AI matchers hallucinate eligibility and under-triage lethal contraindications.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:14,800
Marcus Vance takes Dexamethasone two milligrams BID.

4
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:21,080
Naive LLMs see four milligrams, check the ten-milligram ceiling, and falsely clear him.

5
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:26,000
TrialSwarm coordinates five agents on an Antigravity swarm.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,200
Extractor and Phenotyper parse protocol and EHR in parallel.

7
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:37,570
Rule R1 converts Dexamethasone to twenty-six point seven milligrams Prednisone equivalent.

8
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,200
Verdict: Contraindicated.

9
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:44,500
The Verifier enforces Rule R6: every claim is line-anchored to source text,

10
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:49,920
blocking hallucinations before CRC sign-off.

11
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:54,500
One hundred percent accuracy on one hundred twenty cases.

12
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:58,330
Zero-cost deterministic compute. Built, shipped, and live.
